PhoneBox 0.6.9 (620c904) — pager: fast settle (200 ms) + page buttons in landscape.
Why: the browser's own smooth-scroll / scroll-snap settle animation takes 520–690 ms on the phone (independent of CPU throttling).
- goPage(i): own rAF settle (SETTLE_MS 200, ease-out); overflow-x hidden during settle so a fling cannot overshoot a page.
- Finger on the pager: snap off, native scroll follows the finger; on release, displacement >= 20 % or velocity >= 0.3 px/ms -> next page.
- Widget updates of newly adjacent pages are deferred to the end of the settle (> 50 ms frames 2–5 -> 0–2).
- Landscape: numbered page markers (16x11 px, 44x35 px touch box); portrait unchanged.
Measured: settle 557 ms -> 223 ms.

